what role does jenkins play in your project
    jenkins plays a major role in the project as a ci/cd automation tool ,it is the platform  which enables the chance to create pipelines that automate the software 
    delivery process.jenkins automates all the 5 stages of ci/cd from continuous integration to continuous delivery/deployment which reduces manual errors,faster
    software deliveries.
      
How does your GitHub → Jenkins → Docker deployment flow work?
  add docker file and index.html files to github, go to jenkins place the repository url from github at scm of jenkins after that it is build by depending the
  instructions given in build steps. here in build steps go to execute shell and enter command
  docker build -t mynginx 
  docker run -d -p 8080:80 mynginx
  the first command builds the image from docker file and the second command successfully runs the image on the given port numbers with given name when the job
  is saved and build

